## Threshold Detection Algorithm

The threshold for decoding is: `K' = ceil(K * overhead_factor) + min_overhead`

```rust
impl SymbolSet {
    fn check_threshold(&self, progress: &BlockProgress) -> bool {
        match progress.k {
            Some(k) => {
                let total = progress.source_symbols + progress.repair_symbols;
                let threshold = ((k as f64) * self.threshold_config.overhead_factor).ceil() as usize
                    + self.threshold_config.min_overhead;
                total >= threshold
            }
            None => false, // Cannot determine threshold without K
        }
    }
}
```

## Memory Management

```rust
impl SymbolSet {
    fn estimate_symbol_size(symbol: &Symbol) -> usize {
        std::mem::size_of::<SymbolId>() + symbol.data().len() + 32 // overhead
    }

    fn try_allocate(&mut self, size: usize) -> bool {
        if size <= self.memory_remaining {
            self.memory_remaining -= size;
            true
        } else {
            false
        }
    }

    fn deallocate(&mut self, size: usize) {
        self.memory_remaining += size;
    }
}
```

