## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] OutputFormat enum supports human/json/stream-json/json-pretty/tsv
- [ ] Outputtable trait enables format-agnostic data output
- [ ] Uses std::io::IsTerminal instead of deprecated atty crate
- [ ] CliError follows RFC 9457 structure
- [ ] Exit codes are semantic and documented
- [ ] Progress events stream as JSON in machine mode
- [ ] indicatif progress bars work in human mode
- [ ] NO_COLOR environment variable respected
- [ ] CLICOLOR_FORCE environment variable respected
- [ ] --json shorthand works
- [ ] --no-interactive disables prompts
- [ ] Signal handlers for SIGINT/SIGTERM installed
- [ ] Shell completion generation (bash/zsh/fish/powershell)
- [ ] All unit tests pass
- [ ] All E2E tests pass
- [ ] Guidelines documented with examples

