## Purpose
Implement deterministic network simulation for testing distributed algorithms. This enables reproducible testing of network partitions, latency variations, and message loss scenarios.

## Background
Based on patterns from:
- [Turmoil](https://tokio.rs/blog/2023-01-03-announcing-turmoil): Tokio's deterministic network simulator
- [MadSim](https://github.com/madsim-rs/madsim): Deterministic simulator for Rust
- [Jepsen](https://jepsen.io/): Distributed systems testing tool

