## Logging Strategy

| Location | Level | Message | Fields |
|----------|-------|---------|--------|
| Token created | DEBUG | "Created cancel token" | `token_id`, `object_id` |
| Token cancelled | INFO | "Token cancelled" | `token_id`, `object_id`, `reason`, `kind` |
| Child cancelled | DEBUG | "Child token cancelled" | `parent_token_id`, `child_token_id` |
| Listener notified | TRACE | "Cancel listener notified" | `token_id` |
| Message broadcast | DEBUG | "Broadcasting cancel message" | `token_id`, `object_id`, `peer_count` |
| Message received | DEBUG | "Received cancel message" | `token_id`, `object_id`, `hops` |
| Message forwarded | TRACE | "Forwarding cancel message" | `token_id`, `hops` |
| Duplicate ignored | TRACE | "Ignoring duplicate cancel" | `token_id`, `sequence` |
| Max hops reached | DEBUG | "Cancel message reached max hops" | `token_id`, `max_hops` |
| Cleanup started | DEBUG | "Starting cleanup" | `object_id`, `pending_symbols` |
| Cleanup complete | INFO | "Cleanup complete" | `object_id`, `symbols_cleaned`, `within_budget` |

