## Overview

Implement async signal handling for graceful shutdown and process control.

## Rationale

Signal handling is required for:
- Graceful shutdown on SIGTERM/SIGINT
- Config reload on SIGHUP
- Log rotation on SIGUSR1
- Proper cleanup in containerized environments

